                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "821c2f3f-72d2-3d9d-bad5-413685eab3f4",
                        "entry_id": "74a158e5-c962-3c5b-be59-8cb1efb7fb9f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Disreputable, roguish."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f652f3e4-6c4c-4ca3-9005-5e647551d970",
                                "sense_id": "821c2f3f-72d2-3d9d-bad5-413685eab3f4",
                                "text": "[H]e is dressed in such a rapscallion manner that the people would think you were talking to a house-breaker."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3b3c7e75-9550-448e-b703-0b496e286288",
                                "sense_id": "821c2f3f-72d2-3d9d-bad5-413685eab3f4",
                                "text": "\"I baint a-going to give my master's property to a lot of rapscallion thieves and robbers like you.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "6d400bd3-8860-3908-a446-ca1f029d99c8",
                "word": "rapscallion",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "0e54f532-5bbc-42d4-b0f3-bd4cd3609ab4",
                        "entry_id": "6d400bd3-8860-3908-a446-ca1f029d99c8",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "rapscallions"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2b3cdb29-15b2-3b3a-a4ff-c44a73e80506",
                        "entry_id": "6d400bd3-8860-3908-a446-ca1f029d99c8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A rascal, scamp, rogue, or scoundrel."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "dated"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "55212f4c-a245-4b7f-a86f-8b0afaa1adeb",
                                "sense_id": "2b3cdb29-15b2-3b3a-a4ff-c44a73e80506",
                                "text": "“If I get away I sha’n’t be here,” I says, “to prove these rapscallions ain’t your uncles, and I couldn’t do it if I was here. I could swear they was beats and bummers, that’s all, though that’s worth something."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "034e2667-fe03-4227-b344-dcd547b2638a",
                                "sense_id": "2b3cdb29-15b2-3b3a-a4ff-c44a73e80506",
                                "text": "She was the sister who had remained within the pale; I, the rapscallion of a brother whose vagaries were trying to his relations."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "412da219-1caf-43f0-8082-331ec9f92b40",
                                "sense_id": "2b3cdb29-15b2-3b3a-a4ff-c44a73e80506",
                                "text": "She had a studio built for him on a loft of the carriage house behind the family mansion when he was only ten years old, and she hired a rapscallion German cabinetmaker, who had studied art in Berlin in his youth, to give Father drawing and painting lessons on weekends and after school."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c36aa0f4-70e5-44b5-866e-a1d784646fb5",
                                "sense_id": "2b3cdb29-15b2-3b3a-a4ff-c44a73e80506",
                                "text": "But I’m the kind of rapscallion who often prefers the very good to the GREAT."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5e9d8f32-23e9-42cd-8616-4d451a5823d6",
                        "source_entry_id": "6d400bd3-8860-3908-a446-ca1f029d99c8",
                        "source_sense_id": "2b3cdb29-15b2-3b3a-a4ff-c44a73e80506",
                        "source_sense_description": "rascal",
                        "target_lang_word": "негодяй",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "негодяй",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "88c82231-4383-3761-9d78-bfc9034de9c8",
                                        "entry_id": "5d9ecab8-9011-3ce0-bb03-2bd4c4abac56",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "бран. негодный, подлый, низкий человек, внушающий негодование"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b5a9dd10-5e37-4f89-a046-a6eccd26afef",
                                                "sense_id": "88c82231-4383-3761-9d78-bfc9034de9c8",
                                                "text": "Впрочем, ей нечего говорить, скажу её мужу, что я негодяй, обманывал его."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0295f382-1448-4a78-a998-f32eb3c4cfab",
                                                "sense_id": "88c82231-4383-3761-9d78-bfc9034de9c8",
                                                "text": "— Телегин негодяй и преступник, военным судом он будет расстрелян."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "275753a8-7b50-469e-8431-02853d1d716f",
                                                "sense_id": "88c82231-4383-3761-9d78-bfc9034de9c8",
                                                "text": "Так у этого негодяя ещё и жена — коммунистка?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
